  "title": "Vizsla Silver Files Feasibility Study Technical Report on the Panuco Project - Vizsla Silver Corp.",
  "summary": "Vancouver, British Columbia (December 9, 2025) – Vizsla Silver Corp. (TSX: VZLA) (NYSE: VZLA) (Frankfurt: 0G3) (“Vizsla” or the “Company”) is pleased to announce the filing of a technical report titled, “Panuco Project – NI 43-101 Technical Report and Feasibility Study” (the “FS”), with an effective date of November 4, 2025. The FS was completed by Ausenco Engineering Canada ULC, […]",
